"java spaces">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><code class="java keyword">break</code><code class="java plain">;&nbsp; </code><code class="java comments">//tùy chọn</code></div><div class="line number8 index7 alt1"><code class="java plain">......&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </code></div><div class="line number9 index8 alt2"><code class="java keyword">case</code> <code class="java plain">gia_tri_n:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </code></div><div class="line number10 index9 alt1"><code class="java spaces">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><code class="java comments">// Khối lệnh n</code></div><div class="line number11 index10 alt2"><code class="java spaces">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><code class="java keyword">break</code><code class="java plain">;&nbsp; </code><code class="java comments">//tùy chọn&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </code></div><div class="line number12 index11 alt1"><code class="java keyword">default</code><code class="java plain">:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </code></div><div class="line number13 index12 alt2"><code class="java spaces">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><code class="java comments">// Khối lệnh này được thực thi </code></div><div class="line number14 index13 alt1"><code class="java spaces">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</code><code class="java comments">// nếu tất cả các điều kiện trên không thỏa mãn </code></div><div class="line number15 index14 alt2"><code class="java plain">}&nbsp;&nbsp; </code></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
                        </div>
